

<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="ko">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>ANGEL MAID CAFE ♡</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

* {

  margin: 0;

  padding: 0;

  box-sizing: border-box;

}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {

  background: #fff9f8;

  color: #76616b;

  font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;

}

a {

  text-decoration: none;

  color: inherit;

}

header {

  background: rgba(255,249,248,0.95);

  border-bottom: 1px solid #f1dce3;

  padding: 20px 15px;

  text-align: center;

  position: sticky;

  top: 0;

  z-index: 10;

}

.logo {

  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  font-size: 27px;

  letter-spacing: 3px;

  color: #c78fa4;

}

.subtitle {

  font-size: 10px;

  letter-spacing: 4px;

  color: #b89aa5;

  margin-top: 5px;

}

nav {

  display: flex;

  justify-content: center;

  gap: 28px;

  margin-top: 18px;

  font-size: 11px;

  letter-spacing: 2px;

}

nav a:hover { color: #d58da9; }

.hero {

  text-align: center;

  padding: 95px 20px 85px;

  background:

    radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #fff 0%, #fff1f4 65%, #fce8ee 100%);

  border-bottom: 1px solid #f3dce4;

}

.hero-small {

  font-size: 12px;

  letter-spacing: 4px;

  color: #c38fa2;

}

.hero h1 {

  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  font-size: clamp(38px, 9vw, 65px);

  font-weight: 400;

  color: #c58da2;

  margin: 20px 0;

}

.hero p {

  font-size: 13px;

  line-height: 2.3;

  color: #947b85;

}

.hero-button {

  display: inline-block;

  margin-top: 30px;

  padding: 13px 35px;

  border: 1px solid #d7a7b7;

  color: #b77e94;

  font-size: 11px;

  letter-spacing: 2px;

  transition: .3s;

}

.hero-button:hover {

  background: #d7a7b7;

  color: white;

}

.section {

  padding: 75px 20px;

  max-width: 1000px;

  margin: auto;

}

.section-title {

  text-align: center;

  margin-bottom: 45px;

}

.section-title h2 {

  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  font-size: 36px;

  font-weight: 400;

  color: #c58da2;

  letter-spacing: 2px;

}

.section-title p {

  font-size: 11px;

  letter-spacing: 3px;

  margin-top: 10px;

  color: #bda0aa;

}

.line {

  width: 45px;

  height: 1px;

  background: #d9afbd;

  margin: 17px auto;

}

/* MENU */

.menu-grid {

  display: grid;

  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);

  gap: 17px;

}

.menu-card {

  background: white;

  border: 1px solid #f1dce3;

  padding: 25px 15px;

  text-align: center;

  transition: .3s;

}

.menu-card:hover {

  transform: translateY(-5px);

  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #e9cdd5;

}

.menu-icon {

  font-size: 28px;

  margin-bottom: 13px;

}

.menu-card h3 {

  font-size: 15px;

  font-weight: 500;

  color: #aa758a;

}

.menu-card p {

  font-size: 10px;

  margin-top: 7px;

  color: #bba6ae;

}

.price {

  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  font-size: 17px;

  margin-top: 15px;

  color: #c58da2;

}

/* MAID */

.maid-box {

  background: white;

  border: 1px solid #efd9e1;

  padding: 15px;

  display: grid;

  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

  gap: 25px;

  align-items: center;

}

.maid-photo {

  width: 100%;

  display: block;

  object-fit: cover;

  border: 5px solid #fff7f8;

}

.maid-info {

  padding: 15px;

}

.maid-label {

  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  font-size: 12px;

  letter-spacing: 3px;

  color: #c58da2;

}

.maid-info h3 {

  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  font-size: 35px;

  font-weight: 400;

  color: #c58da2;

  margin: 12px 0;

}

.maid-korean {

  font-size: 13px;

  color: #a98291;

}

.maid-desc {

  font-size: 12px;

  line-height: 2.2;

  margin-top: 23px;

  color: #927c85;

}

.maid-tags {

  margin-top: 20px;

}

.maid-tags span {

  display: inline-block;

  padding: 6px 10px;

  border: 1px solid #f0d9e1;

  color: #bd899d;

  font-size: 10px;

  margin: 3px;

}

/* NOTICE */

.notice-box {

  background: white;

  border: 1px solid #f0dce3;

  padding: 28px;

  text-align: center;

  font-size: 12px;

  line-height: 2.5;

}

.notice-box strong {

  color: #c58da2;

}

/* FOOTER */

footer {

  background: #f9edf0;

  padding: 40px 20px;

  text-align: center;

  color: #b18c9a;

  font-size: 10px;

  line-height: 2.5;

  letter-spacing: 1px;

}

.footer-logo {

  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

  font-size: 24px;

  margin-bottom: 10px;

  color: #c58da2;

}

@media (max-width: 600px) {

  nav { gap: 17px; font-size: 10px; }

  .maid-box {

    grid-template-columns: 1fr;

  }

  .maid-photo {

    max-height: 470px;

    object-position: center 25%;

  }

  .maid-info { text-align: center; }

  .menu-grid { gap: 10px; }

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

  <div class="logo">ANGEL MAID CAFE</div>

  <div class="subtitle">♡ WELCOME TO OUR LITTLE PARADISE ♡</div>

  <nav>

    <a href="#home">HOME</a>

    <a href="#menu">MENU</a>

    <a href="#maid">MAID</a>

    <a href="#notice">NOTICE</a>

  </nav>

</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">

  <div class="hero-small">୨୧ WELCOME, MASTER ୨୧</div>

  <h1>Angel Maid Cafe</h1>

  <p>

    천사들이 머무는 작은 디저트 천국.<br>

    오늘도 당신을 위한 특별한 하루를 준비했어요.<br>

    부디 행복한 시간을 보내시길!

  </p>

  <a href="#menu" class="hero-button">EXPLORE OUR CAFE ♡</a>

</section>

<section class="section" id="menu">

  <div class="section-title">

    <h2>Our Menu</h2>

    <div class="line"></div>

    <p>SWEET MOMENTS FOR YOU</p>

  </div>

  <div class="menu-grid">

    <div class="menu-card">

      <div class="menu-icon">🍰</div>

      <h3>Strawberry Cake</h3>

      <p>딸기 생크림 케이크</p>

      <div class="price">₩ 7,500</div>

    </div>

    <div class="menu-card">

      <div class="menu-icon">🧁</div>

      <h3>Angel Cupcake</h3>

      <p>엔젤 바닐라 컵케이크</p>

      <div class="price">₩ 5,000</div>

    </div>

    <div class="menu-card">

      <div class="menu-icon">☕</div>

      <h3>Royal Milk Tea</h3>

      <p>로열 밀크티</p>

      <div class="price">₩ 6,000</div>

    </div>

    <div class="menu-card">

      <div class="menu-icon">🍓</div>

      <h3>Pink Ade</h3>

      <p>핑크 스트로베리 에이드</p>

      <div class="price">₩ 6,500</div>

    </div>

    <div class="menu-card">

      <div class="menu-icon">🍮</div>

      <h3>Angel Pudding</h3>

      <p>수제 바닐라 푸딩</p>

      <div class="price">₩ 4,500</div>

    </div>

    <div class="menu-card">

      <div class="menu-icon">🍪</div>

      <h3>Heart Cookie</h3>

      <p>하트 버터 쿠키</p>

      <div class="price">₩ 3,500</div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="section" id="maid">

  <div class="section-title">

    <h2>Our Maid</h2>

    <div class="line"></div>

    <p>MEET YOUR ANGEL</p>

  </div>

  <div class="maid-box">

    <img

      src="baeseul.jpeg"

      alt="Angel Maid Bae Iseul"

      class="maid-photo"

    >

    <div class="maid-info">

      <div class="maid-label">♡ OUR SPECIAL MAID ♡</div>

      <h3>Bae Iseul</h3>

      <div class="maid-korean">배이슬</div>

      <div class="line"></div>

      <div class="maid-desc">

        어서 오세요, 주인님!<br>

        오늘도 찾아와 주셔서 정말 기뻐요.<br>

        이슬이 정성껏 준비한 달콤한 시간,<br>

        함께 즐겨 주실 거죠?<br><br>

        언제나 사랑스러운 미소로<br>

        여러분을 맞이하는 엔젤 메이드예요.

      </div>

      <div class="maid-tags">

        <span>ANGEL</span>

        <span>SWEET</span>

        <span>LOVELY</span>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="section" id="notice">

  <div class="section-title">

    <h2>Notice</h2>

    <div class="line"></div>

    <p>CAFE INFORMATION</p>

  </div>

  <div class="notice-box">

    <strong>♡ ANGEL MAID CAFE ♡</strong><br>

    당신의 하루에 작은 행복을 더해 드립니다.<br><br>

    모든 메뉴는 정성을 담아 준비합니다.<br>

    방문해 주시는 모든 분께 감사드립니다.<br><br>

    <strong>Thank you for visiting us!</strong>

  </div>

</section>

<footer>

  <div class="footer-logo">ANGEL MAID CAFE</div>

  ୨୧ A LITTLE HEAVEN JUST FOR YOU ୨୧<br>

  © 2026 ANGEL MAID CAFE. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.

</footer>

</body>

</html>
